# game/story/chapter1.rpy:20
translate indonesian chapter1_start_f8d7263d:

    # narrator "When my eyes open, the sky is the color of tarnished pewter, and two pale broken moon-rings hang crooked above a horizon of crystalline white ash."
    narrator "Saat mataku terbuka, langit berwarna kelabu timah kusam, dan dua cincin bulan pucat yang retak menggantung miring di atas cakrawala abu putih berkristal."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:21
translate indonesian chapter1_start_6193c71f:

    # narrator "No telephone wires. No sirens. Just ruined basalt arches half-swallowed by glittering salt drifts."
    narrator "Tak ada kabel telepon. Tak ada raungan sirene. Hanya lengkungan-lengkungan basal runtuh yang separuh tertelan gundukan garam berkilauan."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:26
translate indonesian chapter1_start_9bcaca8c:

    # thought "Hold on."
    thought "Tunggu dulu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:27
translate indonesian chapter1_start_8ef5df12:

    # thought "Broken moons. Ancient stone pillars. Mysterious robed kidnapper—okay, coat-wearing kidnapper—kneeling five feet away swearing at a brass sphere."
    thought "Bulan yang pecah. Pilar-pilar batu purba. Penculik misterius berjubah—ralat, bermantel—sedang berlutut satu setengah meter dariku sambil memaki-maki bola kuningan."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:28
translate indonesian chapter1_start_ae8ef095:

    # thought "Wait a second. Wait just one second. Did it actually happen?!"
    thought "Tunggu sebentar. Tunggu dulu sebentar. Ini sungguhan kejadian?!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:31
translate indonesian chapter1_start_67efcd46:

    # leo "I'm... in another world."
    leo "Aku... ada di dunia lain."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:32
translate indonesian chapter1_start_de430d4f:

    # thought "Twenty-six years! Twenty-six years of eating microwave rice over the sink, and finally—FINALLY—the universe read my file!"
    thought "Dua puluh enam tahun! Dua puluh enam tahun makan nasi microwave sambil berdiri di depan wastafel, dan akhirnya—AKHIRNYA—semesta membaca berkasku!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:37
translate indonesian chapter1_start_dedb2cd2:

    # vespera "Stop grinning like a concussed turnip and hold still while I read your mass index."
    vespera "Berhenti nyengir seperti lobak gegar otak dan diamlah selagi kubaca indeks massamu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:38
translate indonesian chapter1_start_083d54a6:

    # narrator "My kidnapper taps her smoking brass astrolabe with a wrench. A thin cyan beam sweeps from my damp sneakers to my hairline, then lets out a sound like a deflating bagpipe."
    narrator "Penculikku mengetuk astrolab kuningannya yang berasap dengan kunci inggris. Seberkas sinar sian tipis menyapu dari sepatu ketsku yang lembap sampai ke batas rambutku, lalu mengeluarkan bunyi mirip kantung pipa yang kempes."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:41
translate indonesian chapter1_start_c19462b0:

    # vespera "...Strength: two. Martial Resonance: zero. Lower-lumbar curvature: alarming."
    vespera "...Kekuatan: dua. Resonansi Bela Diri: nol. Kelengkungan tulang punggung bawah: mengkhawatirkan."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:42
translate indonesian chapter1_start_a0537e36:

    # vespera "Explain yourself! When I cast the net from the Cindervale seam, your 'Unfulfilled Heroic Longing' spiked higher than a Royal Templar's! What were you doing on the other side, leading a doomed rebellion?!"
    vespera "Jelaskan sekarang juga! Waktu kutebar jaring dari celah Cindervale, angka 'Hasrat Kepahlawanan Tak Tersampaikan' milikmu melonjak lebih tinggi daripada Templar Kerajaan! Memangnya kau sedang apa di seberang sana, memimpin pemberontakan bunuh diri?!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:45
translate indonesian chapter1_start_b0c08452:

    # leo "I was waiting for my hoodies to finish spin-cycle!"
    leo "Aku sedang menunggu jaket bertudungku selesai putaran peras!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:46
translate indonesian chapter1_start_fc4fdefe:

    # vespera "Your {i}what{/i}?!"
    vespera "Putaran {i}apa{/i}?!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:47
translate indonesian chapter1_start_0901d689:

    # leo "Wait—aren't you a princess, or a court mage summoning the Seventh Hero to defeat a Demon King?!"
    leo "Tunggu—bukannya kau ini tuan putri, atau penyihir istana yang memanggil Pahlawan Ketujuh untuk mengalahkan Raja Iblis?!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:49
translate indonesian chapter1_start_0ef2fd94:

    # narrator "For three full seconds, the wind whistles across the salt plain while she stares at me as though I just offered to lick a plague rat."
    narrator "Selama tiga detik penuh, angin menderu melintasi dataran garam sementara ia menatapku seolah aku baru saja menawarkan diri untuk menjilat tikus pembawa sampar."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:52
translate indonesian chapter1_start_b8ba243f:

    # vespera "Kid. Look behind you."
    vespera "Bocah. Lihat ke belakangmu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:53
translate indonesian chapter1_start_878c3ac8:

    # narrator "She points a scarred gloved thumb toward the miles of dead, chalk-white wasteland stretching west where forests clearly used to stand."
    narrator "Ia mengacungkan ibu jari bersarung tangan penuh bekas luka ke arah hamparan tanah tandus seputih kapur yang membentang bermil-mil ke barat—tempat hutan lebat jelas pernah berdiri."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:54
translate indonesian chapter1_start_eea0565d:

    # vespera "See all that dead salt? That {i}used{/i} to be Oakhaven Valley before the Sixth 'Chosen Hero' unleashed his glorious final sword-beam twenty years ago."
    vespera "Kau lihat semua garam mati itu? Itu {i}dulunya{/i} Lembah Oakhaven, sebelum 'Pahlawan Terpilih' Keenam melepaskan tebasan cahaya pamungkasnya yang agung dua puluh tahun silam."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:55
translate indonesian chapter1_start_05bfa507:

    # vespera "My name is Vespera Kael. I'm a Recall Broker. I get paid—badly—to {i}shut down{/i} summoning seams and send delusional Outworlders home before they 'save' another province into glass."
    vespera "Namaku Vespera Kael. Aku Pialang Pemulangan. Aku dibayar—dengan upah menyedihkan—untuk {i}menutup{/i} celah-celah pemanggilan dan memulangkan para Pendatang Dunia Luar yang mabuk khayalan sebelum mereka 'menyelamatkan' satu provinsi lagi menjadi lautan kaca."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:66
translate indonesian chapter1_start_ff555634:

    # vespera "Honestly? The fact that your face just crumpled instead of shouting about destiny is the first reassuring thing about you."
    vespera "Jujur saja? Kenyataan bahwa wajahmu langsung kusut bukannya berteriak soal takdir adalah hal paling melegakan yang kulihat darimu sejauh ini."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:67
translate indonesian chapter1_start_0d540fc7:

    # vespera "Come on. My astrolabe cracked on re-entry, which means neither of us is sending you back to your 'spin-cycle' until Master Orin solders the lens."
    vespera "Ayo jalan. Astrolabku retak waktu menembus balik celah tadi, artinya tak seorang pun dari kita bisa memulangkanmu ke 'putaran peras'-mu sampai Tetua Orin mematri lensanya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:74
translate indonesian chapter1_start_28cd244f:

    # vespera "...Huh. There's a pulse under the wet cardigan after all."
    vespera "...Heh. Ternyata memang ada denyut nadi di balik kardigan basah itu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:75
translate indonesian chapter1_start_e5d3a013:

    # vespera "Fair point. Unlawful abduction, botched coordinates—my fault. Help me plug the Thornwick seam so the town doesn't calcify tonight, and I'll solder this rig and drop you right back on your sidewalk. Deal?"
    vespera "Masuk akal. Penculikan liar, koordinat meleset—salahku. Bantu aku menyumbat celah Thornwick supaya kota itu tidak membatu jadi garam malam ini, lalu kupatri alat ini dan kuturunkan kau tepat di trotoarmu lagi. Sepakat?"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:81
translate indonesian chapter1_start_74b5ee4e:

    # narrator "Vespera's fingers twitch, tugging her leather cuff down over the translucent glass veins."
    narrator "Jari-jari Vespera berkedut, menarik manset kulitnya turun menutupi urat-urat kaca yang tembus pandang itu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:82
translate indonesian chapter1_start_676836dd:

    # vespera "...Observant, aren't you? Yeah. Grade-two Hero-Scar. Keeps me honest about who pays the bill for miracles."
    vespera "...Jeli juga matamu, ya? Yah. Luka-Pahlawan tingkat dua. Pengingat supaya aku tidak pernah lupa siapa yang harus menanggung tagihan atas sebuah mukjizat."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:94
translate indonesian chapter1_start_4ee6f5e7:

    # narrator "Twenty minutes down the ridge, the white salt gives way to terraced dark stone, slate roofs, waterwheels, and the mouthwatering smell of wood-fired barley bread."
    narrator "Dua puluh menit menuruni punggung bukit, hamparan garam putih berganti menjadi teras-teras batu gelap, atap batusabak, kincir air, dan aroma roti jelai panggang kayu yang menerbitkan air liur."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:95
translate indonesian chapter1_start_d6a5fac1:

    # narrator "Thornwick doesn't look like an elven capital from a painting. It looks lived-in, muddy, stubborn, and busy."
    narrator "Thornwick sama sekali tidak tampak seperti ibu kota bangsa peri dari lukisan. Kota ini tampak nyata dihuni, berlumpur, keras kepala, dan sibuk."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:96
translate indonesian chapter1_start_32d5c026:

    # narrator "A seven-foot horned smith argues mortar prices with a bark-skinned herbalist; two kids chase a plump moss-beetle past a wooden signboard nailed prominently to the gatehouse:"
    narrator "Seorang pandai besi bertanduk setinggi dua meter berdebat soal harga adukan semen dengan peramu obat berkulit pepagan; dua bocah mengejar kumbang lumut gemuk melewati papan kayu yang dipaku mencolok di pos gerbang:"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:97
translate indonesian chapter1_start_727d78b2:

    # narrator "{b}NOTICE: UNAUTHORIZED CHOSEN ONES, PROPHECY BEARERS & DOOM-SLAYERS MUST REGISTER SURETY DEPOSIT (40 CROWNS). VIOLATORS WILL SHOVEL DRAINAGE DITCH B.{/b}"
    narrator "{b}PENGUMUMAN: ORANG TERPILIH, PENGEMBAN NUBUAT & PEMBASMI MALAPETAKA TANPA IZIN WAJIB MENYETOR UANG JAMINAN (40 MAHKOTA). PELANGGAR AKAN MENYEKOP PARIT DRAINASE B.{/b}"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:103
translate indonesian chapter1_start_9aaf022b:

    # clerk "Halt right there, Kael! Don't think I didn't see the ozone flash on the salt ridge!"
    clerk "Berhenti di situ, Kael! Jangan kira aku tidak melihat kilatan ozon di punggung bukit garam tadi!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:105
translate indonesian chapter1_start_6331dc5d:

    # narrator "A nearsighted municipal clerk with an ink-stained tabard and an iron clipboard marches out from the weigh-station, squinting straight at my nylon windbreaker."
    narrator "Seorang juru tulis kota bermata rabun jauh dengan tabard bernoda tinta dan papan jalan besi berderap keluar dari pos timbang, menyipit lurus ke arah jaket angin nilonku."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:106
translate indonesian chapter1_start_9a231345:

    # clerk "Unnatural synthetic weave! Slouched shoulders! Starry-eyed bewilderment! That's an unregistered Outworlder!"
    clerk "Tenunan sintetis tak wajar! Bahu membungkuk! Tatapan bingung berbinar-binar! Itu jelas Pendatang Dunia Luar tak terdaftar!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:115
translate indonesian chapter1_start_d196f520:

    # clerk "'FEAR NOT'?! Section Four—verbal threats of unsolicited deliverance! Forty Brass Crowns, payable by sundown!"
    clerk "'JANGAN TAKUT'?! Pasal Empat—ancaman lisan penyelamatan tanpa diminta! Empat puluh Mahkota Kuningan, wajib lunas sebelum matahari terbenam!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:117
translate indonesian chapter1_start_aa8bbc02:

    # vespera "I look away for {i}four seconds{/i} and you say 'Fear not' in a charter town. Incredible."
    vespera "Aku baru meleng {i}empat detik{/i} dan kau sudah bilang 'Jangan takut' di kota berpiagam. Luar biasa."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:123
translate indonesian chapter1_start_4e79282c:

    # clerk "...A clerk? Let me see your hands."
    clerk "...Juru tulis? Coba kulihat tanganmu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:124
translate indonesian chapter1_start_498a3839:

    # narrator "Clerk Fen inspects my soft, keyboard-calloused palms and nods approvingly."
    narrator "Juru Tulis Fen memeriksa telapak tanganku yang halus dan hanya kapalan karena papan ketik, lalu mengangguk puas."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:125
translate indonesian chapter1_start_3ef124d1:

    # clerk "Not a sword-blister in sight! Refreshing! Still, unregistered portal transit carries a ten-crown administrative stamp—see Mistress Halda at the ovens if you want to work it off."
    clerk "Tak ada satu pun lepuhan gagang pedang! Menyegarkan sekali! Meski begitu, transit portal tak terdaftar tetap kena bea meterai administrasi sepuluh mahkota—temui Nyonya Halda di tungku roti kalau kau mau menebusnya dengan kerja."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:133
translate indonesian chapter1_start_bd73f606:

    # clerk "...Sub-clause seven: 'Inert Cross-Planar Ballast.' Well I'll be salted. An Outworlder who reads municipal signage!"
    clerk "...Sub-klausul tujuh: 'Muatan Pemberat Lintas-Dimensi Inersia.' Demi garam semesta. Ada Pendatang Dunia Luar yang membaca plang peraturan kota!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:134
translate indonesian chapter1_start_8005e86d:

    # vespera "Ha! Take notes, Fen—my ballast knows how to read!"
    vespera "Ha! Catat itu, Fen—muatan pemberatku tahu cara membaca!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:140
translate indonesian chapter1_start_ebf8c89b:

    # narrator "Before Clerk Fen can dry his quill, a heavy iron tower-shield {i}clangs{/i} onto the cobblestones beside us—followed by the aroma of toasted cumin and garlic."
    narrator "Sebelum Juru Tulis Fen sempat mengeringkan pena bulunya, sebuah perisai menara dari besi berat menghantam batu jalanan di samping kami dengan bunyi {i}klang{/i} nyaring—disusul semerbak aroma jintan sangrai dan bawang putih."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:149
translate indonesian chapter1_start_af534336:

    # bram "Oi, Vespera! Orin said your astrolabe popped a lens again! Is {i}this{/i} the anchor you fished out? Look at him, a stiff breeze off the salt flats'll fold him like a crepe!"
    bram "Oi, Vespera! Kata Orin lensa astrolabmu pecah lagi! Apa {i}ini{/i} jangkar yang kau pancing keluar? Lihat dia, ditiup angin kencang dari dataran garam juga langsung terlipat macam dadar tipis!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:151
translate indonesian chapter1_start_f9dd3055:

    # leo "H-hi. Sorry for being foldable."
    leo "H-hai. Maaf karena gampang terlipat."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:153
translate indonesian chapter1_start_a920744a:

    # bram "Agh, there it is! Apologizing for existing! Rule one of Cindervale, string-bean: save 'sorry' for when you step on somebody's tail, and stand with your ribs over your hips! Name's Bram!"
    bram "Argh, nah kan! Ada di dunia saja pakai minta maaf! Aturan pertama di Cindervale, kacang panjang: simpan kata 'maaf' kalau kau menginjak ekor orang saja, dan berdirilah dengan tulang rusuk tegak di atas pinggul! Namaku Bram!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:155
translate indonesian chapter1_start_b26d9ccf:

    # narrator "Despite the volume, the broad-shouldered Korrigan shoves a warm waxed-paper parcel into my freezing hands—fresh flatbread smeared with roasted marrow-butter."
    narrator "Kendati suaranya menggelegar, Korrigan berbahu bidang itu menjejalkan bungkusan kertas lilin hangat ke tanganku yang membeku—roti pipih hangat beroles mentega sumsum panggang."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:158
translate indonesian chapter1_start_80078528:

    # bram "Eat that before your teeth rattle loose. Orin's waiting up in the glasshouse."
    bram "Makan itu sebelum gigimu gemeretak sampai copot. Orin sudah menunggu di rumah kaca di atas."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:168
translate indonesian chapter1_start_822cc370:

    # narrator "Stepping through Master Orin's steamed cedar doors feels like walking straight into a childhood summer I'd forgotten existed."
    narrator "Melangkah menembus pintu kayu aras Tetua Orin yang berembun hangat rasanya seperti berjalan masuk ke musim panas masa kecil yang sudah kulupakan pernah ada."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:169
translate indonesian chapter1_start_30aafcce:

    # narrator "Inside the salvaged glass dome, shielded from Cindervale's ash winds, stretches a living carpet of ordinary, vibrant {b}green grass{/b} and white three-leaf clover."
    narrator "Di dalam kubah kaca hasil rakitan barang bekas itu, terlindung dari angin abu Cindervale, terhampar permadani hidup dari {b}rumput hijau{/b} segar yang biasa dan semanggi putih berdaun tiga."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:170
translate indonesian chapter1_start_a9e418a8:

    # narrator "Warm loam. Damp earthworms. Sunlight refracted through misted panes."
    narrator "Tanah gembur yang hangat. Cacing tanah yang lembap. Cahaya matahari yang terbias menembus kaca-kaca berkabut."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:172
translate indonesian chapter1_start_762f520e:

    # leo "...It's just grass. Regular park grass."
    leo "...Ini cuma rumput. Rumput taman biasa."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:186
translate indonesian chapter1_start_5d252a57:

    # orin "Not 'just' grass here, Master Leo. Four hundred winters ago, those seeds rode into Solvara wedged in the mud of the First Outworlder's heel."
    orin "Di tempat ini bukan 'cuma' rumput, Tuan Leo. Empat ratus musim dingin silam, benih-benih itu terbawa masuk ke Solvara, terselip di lumpur pada tumit Pendatang Pertama."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:187
translate indonesian chapter1_start_5499a5c8:

    # orin "Go on. Kneel down. Press your palm to it."
    orin "Silakan. Berlututlah. Tempelkan telapak tanganmu ke atasnya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:189
translate indonesian chapter1_start_99a2c551:

    # narrator "Self-consciously, I crouch and rest my bare fingers in the cool blades. My racing pulse slows for the first time since 2:38 AM."
    narrator "Dengan agak canggung, aku berjongkok dan meletakkan jari-jari telanjangku di sela helai-helai rumput yang sejuk. Denyut nadiku yang sedari tadi berpacu akhirnya melambat untuk pertama kalinya sejak pukul 02.38 dini hari."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:193
translate indonesian chapter1_start_0b175b91:

    # orin "Every flashy spell cast by a 'Hero' drinks the green life out of soil—or drinks the caster's own memories when the soil runs dry."
    orin "Setiap mantra menyilaukan yang dilepaskan seorang 'Pahlawan' meneguk habis kehidupan hijau dari dalam tanah—atau meneguk ingatan perapalnya sendiri saat tanah telah mengering."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:194
translate indonesian chapter1_start_f871069f:

    # orin "Vespera tells me you grew up wishing to be a hero, lad. Tell an old chronicler truthfully: {i}why{/i}?"
    orin "Kata Vespera, kau tumbuh besar dengan mendambakan jadi pahlawan, nak. Katakan sejujurnya pada pencatat sejarah tua ini: {i}mengapa{/i}?"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:201
translate indonesian chapter1_start_0e566ef1:

    # orin "Bless you for not lying to an old poet. Half the tragedies in my history books started with men who felt small and mistook applause for medicine."
    orin "Syukurlah kau tidak berdusta pada penyair tua ini. Separuh tragedi di dalam buku-buku sejarahku berawal dari orang-orang yang merasa kerdil lalu mengira tepuk tangan adalah obatnya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:208
translate indonesian chapter1_start_8acb0c7e:

    # orin "Ah. Now {i}that{/i} requires neither a glowing blade nor a prophecy, lad. Only two boots that refuse to walk past."
    orin "Ah. Kalau untuk {i}itu{/i}, kau tak butuh pedang bercahaya ataupun nubuat, nak. Cukup sepasang sepatu bot yang menolak melangkah pergi begitu saja."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:215
translate indonesian chapter1_start_19021967:

    # vespera "Careful, Orin, keep him talking and I might actually start liking him."
    vespera "Hati-hati, Orin, kalau kau biarkan dia bicara terus, lama-lama aku bisa beneran menyukainya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:217
translate indonesian chapter1_start_82495437:

    # narrator "Master Orin lifts a sturdy ash-wood trenching spade inlaid with spirals of dull copper wire and rests it across my palms."
    narrator "Tetua Orin mengangkat sebatang sekop parit kokoh dari kayu ash yang bertatahkan pilinan kawat tembaga kusam, lalu meletakkannya di atas kedua telapak tanganku."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:220
translate indonesian chapter1_start_1bfad993:

    # orin "No Excalibur in my shed, Leo. Only a Rootwarden's Grounding Spade. Instead of cutting monsters in half, copper-craft conducts wild Resonance safely back into deep stone."
    orin "Tak ada Excalibur di gudangku, Leo. Hanya Sekop Pembumian milik Penjaga Akar. Alih-alih membelah monster jadi dua, kriya tembaga ini menyalurkan Resonansi liar kembali dengan aman ke batu-batuan dalam."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:221
translate indonesian chapter1_start_8b299008:

    # vespera "And we're going to need it by dusk. The Old Aqueduct seam is humming, and Orin needs an hour for the silver-solder to set on my astrolabe."
    vespera "Dan kita bakal membutuhkannya menjelang senja nanti. Celah Akuaduk Tua mulai berdengung, sementara Orin butuh waktu sejam agar patri perak di astrolabku mengeras."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:222
translate indonesian chapter1_start_4ffef75a:

    # vespera "Look around town, get your bearings, don't shout any battle cries—and meet Bram and me at the Old Aqueduct before sundown."
    vespera "Kelilingilah kota, kenali medanmu, jangan coba-coba meneriakkan pekik perang—dan temui aku serta Bram di Akuaduk Tua sebelum matahari terbenam."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:327
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_9e18f44d:

    # bram "Aha! The human question-mark wanders into my kitchen! Apron's on the peg—grab that paring knife and skin six bulbs of black garlic before the stock boils!"
    bram "Aha! Si manusia tanda tanya nyasar juga ke dapurku! Celemek ada di gantungan—ambil pisau kupas itu dan kuliti enam bonggol bawang putih hitam sebelum kaldunya mendidih!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:328
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_bde18cf3:

    # leo "Wait, isn't a Vanguard shield-bearer supposed to be sharpening greatswords or brooding in a corner booth?"
    leo "Tunggu, bukankah pembawa perisai garis depan mestinya mengasah pedang besar atau merenung suram di meja pojok?"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:329
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_f2ab2fca:

    # bram "Brooding doesn't keep twenty cold masons alive on night-watch, Leo! Bad soup kills morale faster than goblins!"
    bram "Merenung suram tak bikin dua puluh tukang batu yang kedinginan tetap hidup waktu jaga malam, Leo! Sup hambar membunuh semangat tempur lebih cepat daripada goblin!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:331
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_53563f11:

    # narrator "For ten surprisingly peaceful minutes, we chop root vegetables side by side—until an iron grain-chute slams shut in the cellar below with a deafening {i}BOOM{/i}."
    narrator "Selama sepuluh menit yang mengherankan tenangnya, kami memotong umbi-umbian berdampingan—sampai pintu luncur gandum dari besi di ruang bawah tanah terbanting menutup dengan bunyi {i}DUM{/i} yang memekakkan telinga."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:336
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_3d30c5c1:

    # narrator "Bram's paring knife clatters onto the butcher block. Both of his huge hands grip the edge of the table, knuckles chalk-white, chest heaving as his chipped left horn hums with sub-audible panic."
    narrator "Pisau kupas Bram jatuh bergeletakan ke atas talenan tebal. Kedua tangannya yang besar mencengkeram tepi meja hingga buku-buku jarinya memutih bagai kapur, dadanya naik-turun memburu sementara tanduk kirinya yang gompal berdengung lirih oleh kepanikan."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:344
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_e357cd70:

    # leo "In for four... hold four... out for six. It was just the grain chute in the cellar, Bram. Ceiling's solid oak."
    leo "Tarik empat hitungan... tahan empat... embuskan enam. Itu cuma corong gandum di ruang bawah tanah, Bram. Langit-langit ini kayu ek padat."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:345
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_a2ebfd4f:

    # narrator "Ten seconds pass. Slowly, Bram's shoulders drop. He takes a shaky swig of water and wipes his brow with his forearm."
    narrator "Sepuluh detik berlalu. Perlahan, bahu Bram turun mengendur. Ia meneguk air dengan tangan bergetar lalu menyeka dahinya menggunakan lengan bawah."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:347
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_338a32d6:

    # bram "...How'd an office shrimp know breath-pacing?"
    bram "...Bagaimana udang kantoran sepertimu bisa tahu cara mengatur napas begitu?"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:348
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_34ff3046:

    # leo "Try riding a crowded subway car when you haven't slept in thirty hours. Panic's panic, horns or not."
    leo "Coba saja naik gerbong kereta bawah tanah yang penuh sesak waktu kau belum tidur tiga puluh jam. Panik tetaplah panik, bertanduk atau tidak."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:349
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_a9607fcb:

    # bram "Heh. Bastion Mine collapse, two winters back. Held a timber beam on my horn till the rookies crawled clear, then froze cold for an hour after. Vigil called it 'unfit nerves.'"
    bram "Heh. Runtuhnya Tambang Bastion, dua musim dingin lalu. Aku menahan balok kayu penyangga dengan tandukku sampai para prajurit baru merangkak keluar dengan selamat, lalu mematung kaku selama sejam penuh sesudahnya. Penjaga Abu menyebutnya 'saraf tak layak tempur.'"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:350
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_172ad99a:

    # bram "Thanks for not gawking, Leo. Here—take an extra ration pack for tonight."
    bram "Makasih sudah tidak melongo melihatku, Leo. Nih—bawa satu bungkus ransum tambahan buat malam ini."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:357
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_9831717e:

    # narrator "My forearms scream in protest, but I wrestle the forty-pound iron pot onto the trivet before the barley burns."
    narrator "Otot lengan bawahku menjerit protes, tapi aku berhasil mengangkat panci besi seberat hampir dua puluh kilo itu ke atas tatakan kaki tiga sebelum jelainya gosong."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:359
translate indonesian ch1_scene_inn_bram_b130f3f0:

    # bram "Ha! Saved the broth! Sorry about that—loud cellar bangs still rattle my horn-nerves from my Vigil days. You've got decent grip strength when you forget to overthink!"
    bram "Ha! Kaldunya selamat! Maaf soal barusan—dentuman keras dari ruang bawah tanah masih suka mengguncang saraf tandukku sejak zamanku di Penjaga Abu. Cengkeramanmu lumayan kuat juga kalau kau lupa kebanyakan mikir!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:377
translate indonesian ch1_scene_conservatory_4a786ce9:

    # narrator "At the potting bench, Vespera holds magnifying goggles over one eye while threading molten silver-solder along her astrolabe's outer ring. Beside her lies a stack of parchment covered in fierce ink strikethroughs."
    narrator "Di meja tanam, Vespera menahan kacamata pembesar di satu matanya sembari mengalirkan patri perak cair di sepanjang cincin luar astrolabnya. Di sebelahnya tergeletak setumpuk perkamen yang dipenuhi coretan tinta ganas."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:379
translate indonesian ch1_scene_conservatory_9df2ae76:

    # vespera "Steady the Vernier dial for me, Leo. Three millimeters clockwise—don't sneeze."
    vespera "Pegang piringan Vernier ini biar stabil, Leo. Tiga milimeter searah jarum jam—awas kalau bersin."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:385
translate indonesian ch1_scene_conservatory_3627645d:

    # narrator "The brass rings chime in clear, resonant fifths. As Vespera tests the latch, I glance at Master Orin's crossed-out poem: {i}'The Lay of the Fifth Dawn.'{/i}"
    narrator "Cincin-cincin kuningan itu berdenting jernih dalam harmoni nada kuint. Saat Vespera menguji pengaitnya, mataku melirik puisi Tetua Orin yang penuh coretan: {i}'Balada Fajar Kelima.'{/i}"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:386
translate indonesian ch1_scene_conservatory_e6c2d053:

    # orin "You're looking at my old sin, lad. Forty years ago, my verses convinced a baker's daughter from Eastford that dying gloriously at seventeen was nobler than growing gray."
    orin "Kau sedang menatap dosa lamaku, nak. Empat puluh tahun silam, bait-baitku meyakinkan putri seorang pembuat roti dari Eastford bahwa gugur mulia di usia tujuh belas tahun jauh lebih luhur daripada menua hingga beruban."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:388
translate indonesian ch1_scene_conservatory_d71362e8:

    # orin "When you face that seam tonight, promise me something: do not try to look impressive. Try to come back for breakfast."
    orin "Saat kau menghadapi celah itu malam nanti, berjanjilah satu hal padaku: jangan berusaha terlihat mengagumkan. Berusahalah kembali pulang untuk sarapan."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:407
translate indonesian ch1_scene_square_8e3fdfff:

    # baker "You're the Outworlder who didn't blow up my chimney! Come here—either stack those salt-insulated kiln bricks, or check Fen's grain tallies before the Concordat tax-rider cheats us again!"
    baker "Kau Pendatang Dunia Luar yang tidak meledakkan cerobong asapku itu, kan! Sini—pilih menumpuk bata tungku berinsulasi garam itu, atau periksa catatan hitung gandum Fen sebelum penarik pajak Konkordat menipu kami lagi!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:414
translate indonesian ch1_scene_square_f56589a9:

    # narrator "By the twentieth brick, dust coats my eyebrows and my back aches—a clean, honest ache completely different from hunching over spreadsheets."
    narrator "Memasuki bata kedua puluh, debu menyelimuti alisku dan punggungku pegal—rasa pegal yang bersih dan jujur, sama sekali berbeda dari pegal akibat membungkuk berjam-jam di depan tabel data."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:415
translate indonesian ch1_scene_square_c17ed65c:

    # baker "Ha! Slow as an ox, twice as careful! Clerk Fen, tear up his ticket and pay the boy five crowns on top!"
    baker "Ha! Lambatnya macam lembu, tapi hati-hatinya dua kali lipat! Juru Tulis Fen, robek surat dendanya dan beri bocah ini tambahan lima mahkota!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:422
translate indonesian ch1_scene_square_67bd1cb1:

    # leo "Hold on—row fourteen double-counts sack weight on wet barley. You've been overpaying the eastern capital by eleven percent."
    leo "Tunggu dulu—baris empat belas menghitung ganda bobot karung pada jelai basah. Bapak dan Ibu selama ini kelebihan membayar ke ibu kota timur sebesar sebelas persen."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:423
translate indonesian ch1_scene_square_df3d369c:

    # clerk "Eleven—?! Sweet merciful mortar! Mistress Halda, give this Outworlder a loaf and fifty brass crowns!"
    clerk "Sebelas—?! Demi adukan semen yang mahamurah! Nyonya Halda, beri Pendatang Dunia Luar ini setangkup roti dan lima puluh mahkota kuningan!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:439
translate indonesian ch1_scene_shrine_f31c12c5:

    # narrator "Just outside Thornwick's western drainage wall stands a headless marble pedestal labeled {i}PARAGON III — DELIVERER OF THE IRON VALE{/i}. Someone has hung wet laundry line from its sword-hilt."
    narrator "Tepat di luar tembok drainase barat Thornwick berdiri sebuah tugu pualam tanpa kepala bertuliskan {i}PARAGON III — SANG PENYELAMAT LEMBAH BESI{/i}. Seseorang telah mengikatkan tali jemuran basah pada gagang pedangnya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:440
translate indonesian ch1_scene_shrine_015cc4aa:

    # narrator "Crouching to inspect the cracked base, I notice tiny English block letters scratched upside-down beneath the plinth—completely invisible unless you're kneeling at mud-level."
    narrator "Saat berjongkok memeriksa dasarnya yang retak, aku melihat huruf-huruf cetak bahasa Inggris mungil yang digoreskan terbalik di kolong umpak batu—mustahil terlihat kecuali kau berlutut sejajar dengan lumpur."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:442
translate indonesian ch1_scene_shrine_a0e07287:

    # thought "Wait... that's modern ballpoint script carved into stone: 'IF YOU'RE READING THIS DOWN IN THE DIRT, CHECK BEHIND THE LOOSE BRICK.'"
    thought "Tunggu... itu gaya tulisan pulpen modern yang dipahat ke batu: 'KALAU KAU MEMBACA INI SAMBIL BERKUBANG DI TANAH, PERIKSA DI BALIK BATA YANG LONGGAR.'"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:444
translate indonesian ch1_scene_shrine_1f41373f:

    # narrator "My heart thumps. I pry free a moss-wedged stone and pull out a small mica-glass locket holding a four-hundred-year-old pressed three-leaf clover."
    narrator "Jantungku berdegup kencang. Aku mencongkel sebongkah batu berlumut dan menarik keluar liontin kaca mika mungil berisi daun semanggi berhelai tiga yang dipres empat ratus tahun silam."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:449
translate indonesian ch1_scene_shrine_58761fe8:

    # thought "'Don't forget to go home when the rain stops.' Whoever the First Outworlder was... they missed Earth too."
    thought "'Jangan lupa pulang saat hujannya reda.' Siapa pun Pendatang Pertama itu... dia juga merindukan Bumi."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:467
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_04f759c3:

    # narrator "At the base of Thornwick's stone aqueduct, violet-white lightning spiderwebs out of a fractured drainage arch! Everywhere the mist touches wet grass along the canal bank, green blades stiffen into brittle white salt."
    narrator "Di kaki akuaduk batu Thornwick, petir putih-lembayung menjalar bagai jaring laba-laba dari lengkungan drainase yang retak! Di setiap titik tempat kabutnya menyentuh rumput basah di sepanjang tanggul kanal, helai-helai hijau langsung mengeras menjadi garam putih yang rapuh."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:473
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_19a8a0d2:

    # bram "Back from the bank, masons! Shieldline up! Vespera, the seam's pulsing twice as hard as last week—if that wave hits the grain terraces, Thornwick starves by winter!"
    bram "Mundur dari tanggul, para tukang batu! Bentuk barisan perisai! Vespera, celahnya berdenyut dua kali lebih ganas dibanding pekan lalu—kalau gelombang itu menghantam teras ladang gandum, Thornwick bakal kelaparan saat musim dingin tiba!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:474
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_e9a04c4d:

    # vespera "I see it! The harmonic pressure's splitting three ways—I can hold the copper leads open, but somebody with zero Resonance bleed has to lock the three astrolabe rings on beat!"
    vespera "Aku melihatnya! Tekanan harmoniknya terpecah ke tiga arah—aku bisa menahan jalur tembaganya tetap terbuka, tapi seseorang tanpa kebocoran Resonansi sedikit pun harus mengunci ketiga cincin astrolab tepat sesuai ketukan!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:475
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_91ebb958:

    # vespera "Leo! Get your question-mark spine over here and plant Orin's spade in the conduit!"
    vespera "Leo! Bawa punggung tanda tanyamu ke sini dan tancapkan sekop Orin ke saluran itu!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:480
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_92ce814e:

    # thought "My knees are shaking so hard my dryer token is jingling in my pocket. Every instinct from twenty-six years says step back and let the real adults handle it."
    thought "Lututku gemetar begitu hebat sampai koin mesin pengering di sakuku ikut bergemerincing. Setiap naluri dari dua puluh enam tahun hidupku menyuruhku mundur dan membiarkan orang-orang dewasa sungguhan yang menanganinya."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:481
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_6d9e1eed:

    # thought "No. Bram's holding a hundred pounds of iron against burning salt-wind. Vespera's wrists are bleeding crystal dust. Breathe in four—and LOCK THE RINGS!"
    thought "Tidak. Bram sedang menahan lima puluh kilo besi melawan angin garam yang membakar. Pergelangan tangan Vespera merembeskan debu kristal berdarah. Tarik napas empat hitungan—dan KUNCI CINCINNYA!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:496
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_d195c4ff:

    # narrator "{i}CLANG—HUMMM.{/i} All three brass rings snap into alignment on the first pass! Copper wire along Orin's spade glows warm amber, drinking the violent purple arc straight down into deep granite until only harmless steam rises off the canal!"
    narrator "{i}KLANG—HUMMM.{/i} Ketiga cincin kuningan itu mengunci sejajar dalam sekali percobaan! Kawat tembaga di sepanjang sekop Orin berpendar kuning ambar hangat, meneguk busur petir ungu yang beringas itu lurus menembus granit dalam hingga hanya uap hangat tak berbahaya yang mengepul dari permukaan kanal!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:498
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_e8121a9e:

    # bram "WOOO! DID YOU SEE THAT?! Not a single turnip salted! Have my babies—wait, no, have my second-best skillet, string-bean!"
    bram "WOOO! KALIAN LIHAT ITU?! Tak ada satu lobak pun yang membatu jadi garam! Jadilah ibu dari anak-anakku—eh, salah, ambil saja wajan terbaik keduaku, kacang panjang!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:500
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_146de535:

    # vespera "...Three rings, zero backlash. Okay, Sato. Maybe my astrolabe didn't miss after all."
    vespera "...Tiga cincin, nol hentakan balik. Oke, Sato. Mungkin astrolabku memang tidak meleset."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:510
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_4779a596:

    # narrator "Sparks singe my knuckles on the second ring, nearly bucking the spade out of my grip—but I jam my heel into the mud, brace against Bram's shoulder, and slam the final brass latch home!"
    narrator "Percikan api menghanguskan buku-buku jariku pada cincin kedua, nyaris melontarkan sekop itu lepas dari genggamanku—namun kuhunjamkan tumitku ke dalam lumpur, bertumpu pada bahu Bram, dan kuhantam pengait kuningan terakhir hingga terkunci rapat!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:511
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_e216b569:

    # narrator "The violet shriek collapses into harmless steam. My hands won't stop trembling, and smell faintly of toasted wool—but the canal water runs clear."
    narrator "Jeritan cahaya lembayung itu luruh menjadi uap yang tak berbahaya. Kedua tanganku tak berhenti gemetar dan samar-samar berbau wol gosong—tetapi air kanal tetap mengalir jernih."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:513
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_50b6d037:

    # bram "Ha! Ugly stance, crooked elbows, ten-out-of-ten finish! Look—the grass on the terrace is still green!"
    bram "Ha! Kuda-kuda berantakan, siku bengkok, tapi hasil akhir sepuluh per sepuluh! Lihat—rumput di teras ladang masih hijau!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:523
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_53907cc4:

    # narrator "The third ring slips—violet static explodes across the arch! Rather than dive clear and let the wave hit the terraces, I throw my weight over the copper spade while Bram slams his tower shield over us both!"
    narrator "Cincin ketiga meleset—listrik statis lembayung meledak melintasi lengkungan batu! Alih-alih melompat menghindar dan membiarkan gelombangnya menghantam teras ladang, kuempaskan seluruh berat tubuhku menekan sekop tembaga sementara Bram menghantamkan perisai menaranya menaungi kami berdua!"

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:524
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_96fb1712:

    # narrator "For one terrifying second I forget the name of my elementary school—then Vespera kicks the emergency ground-spike home, snuffing the rift in a cloud of white steam."
    narrator "Selama sedetik yang mengerikan aku sempat lupa nama sekolah dasarku sendiri—lalu Vespera menendang pasak pembumian darurat hingga tertancap penuh, memadamkan retakan itu dalam kepulan uap putih."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:526
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_23135df3:

    # vespera "Idiot! You took half that arc through your ribs instead of letting go! ...Drink some water. You kept the terraces green."
    vespera "Dasar bodoh! Kau menelan separuh sengatan tadi lewat tulang rusukmu daripada melepaskan pegangan! ...Minumlah dulu. Kau berhasil menjaga teras ladang tetap hijau."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:534
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_8e2abfb5:

    # narrator "For a moment, the masons along the canal bank actually cheer—tossing caps in the air, clapping soot off Bram's armored shoulders, even nodding warmly at my mud-splattered sneakers."
    narrator "Untuk sesaat, para tukang batu di sepanjang tanggul kanal benar-benar bersorak—melemparkan topi ke udara, menepuk jelaga dari bahu berlapis baja Bram, bahkan mengangguk hangat ke arah sepatu ketsku yang belepotan lumpur."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:535
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_feb728f1:

    # thought "Wait. Nobody's laughing. Nobody's calling me Sir Valorian. My hands hurt, my shoes are soaked, and... I actually helped."
    thought "Tunggu. Tidak ada yang menertawakanku. Tidak ada yang mengejekku Sir Valorian. Tanganku perih, sepatuku basah kuyup, dan... aku sungguhan berhasil membantu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:537
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_c6950ff3:

    # narrator "Then three silver war-horns split the twilight from the northern ridge."
    narrator "Lalu tiga sangkakala perang perak membelah senja dari punggung bukit utara."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:545
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_b629f2a9:

    # vespera "...No. Not already. Those are Aurelian Concordat pennants—and Ashen Vigil outriders."
    vespera "...Tidak. Jangan secepat ini. Itu panji-panji Konkordat Aurelia—dan pengawal berkuda Penjaga Abu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:554
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_6ccc4859:

    # narrator "Down the stone causeway strides a young woman in an immaculate cobalt-and-silver envoy coat, starlight motes orbiting her fingertips effortless and blinding—flanked by a tall, silver-templed commander whose grey cloak smells of northern salt-storms."
    narrator "Menuruni jalan batu yang ditinggikan, melangkahlah seorang perempuan muda dalam balutan mantel utusan biru kobalt dan perak tanpa cela; butir-butir cahaya bintang mengorbit ujung jemarinya begitu ringan sekaligus menyilaukan—didampingi seorang komandan jangkung berpelipis perak yang jubah kelabunya beraroma badai garam utara."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:555
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_092bb9d1:

    # narrator "She glances once at the smoking copper spade in my muddy hands, then speaks—in crisp, unmistakable twenty-first-century English."
    narrator "Ia melirik sekilas sekop tembaga berasap di tanganku yang berlumpur, lalu angkat bicara—dalam bahasa Inggris abad kedua puluh satu yang renyah dan tak mungkin salah kukenali."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:557
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_9b083398:

    # sera "You've got to be kidding me, Marshal. {i}This{/i} is the anomalous tether signature from Tuesday night? He looks like he apologizes to automatic doors."
    sera "Yang benar saja, Marsekal. {i}Ini{/i} jejak Jangkar anomali dari Selasa malam itu? Tampangnya saja seperti orang yang minta maaf pada pintu otomatis."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:563
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_c541c236:

    # cassian "Forgive Envoy Lin's bluntness, Master Sato. I am High Marshal Cassian Vey of the Ashen Vigil."
    cassian "Maafkan keterusterangan Utusan Lin, Tuan Sato. Saya Marsekal Tinggi Cassian Vey dari Penjaga Abu."

# game/story/chapter1.rpy:564
translate indonesian ch1_aqueduct_climax_dd868cd3:

    # cassian "Three hours ago, the Sixth Paragon's seal at Fort Bastion fractured by forty cubits. Whether by fate or Broker Kael's meddling... Cindervale is out of time."
    cassian "Tiga jam yang lalu, segel Paragon Keenam di Benteng Bastion retak sepanjang empat puluh hasta. Entah karena takdir atau campur tangan Pialang Kael... waktu Cindervale sudah habis."

translate indonesian strings:

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:62
    old "\"So... there's no legendary sword waiting for me? At all?\" (Be honest about the disappointment)"
    new "\"Jadi... sama sekali tidak ada pedang legendaris yang menungguku? Satu pun?\" (Jujur soal rasa kecewa)"

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:69
    old "\"Hey! You kidnapped ME! The least you can do is drop the attitude!\" (Push back)"
    new "\"Hei! Kau yang menculikku! Setidaknya jangan pasang tampang ketus begitu!\" (Lawan balik)"

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:77
    old "Quietly notice the crystalline burn scars peeking past her cuffs. \"Your wrists... was that from Oakhaven?\""
    new "Diam-diam memperhatikan bekas luka bakar berkristal yang menyembul dari balik mansetnya. \"Pergelangan tanganmu... apakah itu dari Oakhaven?\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:109
    old "Panic and strike what my brain thinks is a reassuringly noble stance. \"Fear not, good citizen!\""
    new "Panik lalu memasang kuda-kuda yang menurut otakku tampak gagah dan menenangkan. \"Jangan takut, warga yang budiman!\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:119
    old "(Charisma / Honesty) Hold up my plastic laundry bag. \"Sir, I'm an underpaid data clerk. If a monster attacked, I'd file a ticket and hide.\""
    new "(Karisma / Kejujuran) Angkat kantong plastik cucianku. \"Pak, saya cuma juru tulis data bergaji pas-pasan. Kalau ada monster menyerang, saya bakal bikin tiket laporan lalu sembunyi.\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:128
    old "(Intelligence 5+) Cite the sign's wording: \"Wait—'Chosen Ones.' Vespera's astrolabe logged me at zero Resonance. Legally I'm cargo, not a Hero!\""
    new "(Kecerdasan 5+) Kutip bunyi plangnya: \"Tunggu—'Orang Terpilih.' Astrolab Vespera mencatat saya dengan Resonansi nol. Secara hukum saya ini kargo, bukan Pahlawan!\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:197
    old "\"Because I was tired of feeling weak and humiliated. I wanted people to finally look up to me.\""
    new "\"Karena saya lelah terus-menerus merasa lemah dan dipermalukan. Saya ingin orang-orang akhirnya menghargai saya.\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:203
    old "\"Because nobody ever showed up when I needed help. I wanted to be the person who actually shows up.\""
    new "\"Karena tidak pernah ada yang datang saat saya butuh pertolongan. Saya ingin menjadi orang yang benar-benar datang.\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:210
    old "\"Honestly? Because fantasy worlds looked simpler than paying rent and disappointing everyone.\""
    new "\"Jujur saja? Karena dunia fantasi kelihatan lebih sederhana daripada membayar uang sewa dan mengecewakan semua orang.\""

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:339
    old "Don't stare or make a scene—quietly slide a mug of cool water next to his elbow and count four-second breaths out loud."
    new "Jangan menatapnya atau membuat keributan—diam-diam geser secangkir air dingin ke dekat sikunya lalu hitung napas empat detik keras-keras."

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:353
    old "Clap his shoulder firmly and haul the heavy stockpot off the boil myself so it doesn't scorch."
    new "Tepuk bahunya dengan mantap lalu angkat sendiri panci kaldu berat itu dari atas api agar tidak gosong."

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:410
    old "Roll up my sleeves and haul kiln bricks alongside the apprentice masons (+Strength, +Reputation)."
    new "Gulung lengan bajuku dan angkut bata tungku bersama para tukang batu magang (+Kekuatan, +Reputasi)."

    # game/story/chapter1.rpy:417
